s` インスタンスを使えば以下のようにできます。\n\n```main(({ vim, denops }) =\u0026gt; {\n  const result = await denops.dispatch('plugin名', 'メソッド', ['引数リスト']);\n});```\nただ、上記だと対象プラグインがロード済みじゃないといけないなどの制約があるので、ラップするか全体のイベントエミッター作るかで対応するかなと思ってます。\n今すぐ使う場合は autocmd とかつかって対象がロードされたことを保証するなどが必要です。","ts":"1618808843.448200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vFl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f830c140-2b28-494f-b0a5-816301ae9795","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"確かにmainの方がわかりやすい","ts":"1618808832.447900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y7ox"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6026992c-6ce8-4fa8-a1d3-48ebc9d74372","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"アップデートしよう","ts":"1618808668.445200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H7bT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37c9efbf-73f1-4f8c-9870-d7f86f4049d4","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"オッ","ts":"1618808664.445100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HV2y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39433e61-01bc-41c0-9605-4bf0873dce2b","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"denops-helloworld のコードも最新版にしてあります","ts":"1618808531.444600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"li6kZ"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"予告通りの変更を加えました。また Zenn の記事も新しい方式にアップデートしました。","ts":"1618808497.443900","files":[{"id":"F01UVKQHT0U","created":1618808489,"timestamp":1618808489,"name":"CleanShot 2021-04-19 at 14.01.00.png","title":"CleanShot 2021-04-19 at 14.01.00.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U776661HA","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":94480,"url":"","