h_text","block_id":"vxw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2abe906c-73d1-457e-beb8-0e7cc6d3cbe8","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"予告：\nいま利用している `start((vim) =\u0026gt; {})` はそのうち廃止されて `main(({vim}) =\u0026gt; {})` になります。\nちなみに、この変更は後方互換性を担保しながら与えるコンテキストを増やしやすくするためです。\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops-std-deno/pull/13\u003e","ts":"1618777564.430500","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: Add 'main()' and deprecate 'start()' by lambdalisue · Pull Request #13 · vim-denops/denops-std-deno","id":1,"title":"Add 'main()' and deprecate 'start()' by lambdalisue · Pull Request #13 · vim-denops/denops-std-deno","title_link":"https://github.com/vim-denops/denops-std-deno/pull/13","text":"Now start() become deprecated and new main() is added. Plugin developers should use main() like: import { main } from \u0026amp;quot;https://deno.land/x/denops_std/mod.ts\u0026amp;quot;; main(async ({ vim }) =\u0026gt; ...","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/24449f872e2ee14a38d6d3ca2e03f515e609b6273627f1897cfdcd96e97f287e/vim-denops/denops-std-deno/pull/13","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/vim-denops/denops-std-deno/pull/13","original_url":"https://github.com/vim-denops/denops-std-deno/pull/13"}],"edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1618778069.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4PN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7dacdae-cf26-44bf-9f70-b7fd1a255243","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/Srinivasa314/msgpack-deno/pull/5\u003e\n\nとりあえず msgpack-deno にメンテ用 PR した","ts":"1618774581.429000","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: Add GitHub Actions and original tests by lambdalisue · Pull Request #5 · Srinivasa314/msgpack-deno","id":1,"title":"Add GitHub Actions and original tests by lambdalisue · Pull Request #5 · Srinivasa314/msgpack-deno","title_link":"https://github.com/Srinivasa314/msgpack-deno/pull/5","text":"Hi. I\u0026amp;#39;m using this library to built msgpack-rpc-deno (to built denops.vim which is an ecosystem of Vim/Neovim) and I\u0026amp;#39;d love to improve the maintenanceability of this project as well. So, wi...","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/4d5264f316ab81602c601605802f72208d5ae6f1b8ef0d408c842699e3e8e0be/Srinivasa314/msgpack-deno/pull/5","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/Srinivasa314/msgpack-deno/pull/5","original_url":"https://github.com/Srinivasa314/msgpack-deno/pull/5"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"72Mj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de69b721-c414-4ab9-9b9f-9b0367aa5402","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そのためのstdか、よき","ts":"1618763795.427700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MIBx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b1c5a72-84bc-4f68-b0c3-db71a9bfaa50","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"依存関係の簡略化のために `denops-deno` 相当のコードを `denops.vim` に移動して `denops_core` というモジュールで配信するようにしました。\nこれに伴い `denops-std-deno` (`denops-std` モジュール) は `denops_core` に依存するようになりました。\n多分いないとは思いますが `denops-deno` (`denops` モジュール) に直接依存している場合は `denops_core` への切り替えをお願いします。","ts":"1618763736.427300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":5,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7B4ZD49X","U7JL1UKKL","UAUFDS92N","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f24"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcca4e9b-6055-4234-b7cd-1604072c5daf","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これだと欠点があって、既存のプラグインがsourceを提供するのに使えない","ts":"1618815604.458900","thread_ts":"1618810055.454000","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YmjHd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32d8b3bb-cd0d-4a65-a336-aa15bc6f8b9c","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"GitHub かローカルファイルを直接読めばいいのでできますよ","ts":"1618815740.459100","thread_ts":"1618810055.454000","edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1618815805.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7CKl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6638618-6fa5-424e-80c6-f777a101f875","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"source 提供したいなら動的に `g:ddc#custom_sources` に自分自身を追加すればいい。それが GitHub の URL でも `file:///....` でも多分大丈夫","ts":"1618815784.459300","thread_ts":"1618810055.454000","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K9cDk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66a9e5c5-93b5-4b51-b149-c5fce83875e0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そうなのか","ts":"1618816464.459600","thread_ts":"1618810055.454000","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MhY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4349b410-01de-4630-bfab-61450afdb1e8","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"試してはいないですが多分行ける","ts":"1618816810.459800","thread_ts":"1618810055.454000","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bsSwt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f329433-5b5f-4f12-a7d0-beea6d51790f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"一度やってみないといけないかな","ts":"1618816983.460000","thread_ts":"1618810055.454000","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MJw"}]}]
